  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception interface, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification encodes safe, conservative exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery turns are chosen deterministically based on obstacle location. Full_rotate is reserved for repeated or dead-end obstacle encounters. All obstacle events force the supervisor into a recovery state with a single allowed turn action, ensuring safety and avoiding oscillations.",
