    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception: G1 for motion commands, G2 for perception outcomes.",
    "Specification E1 encodes safe exploration with deterministic recovery, preferring random_walk in clear, rotate_clockwise for front/left obstacles, rotate_counterclockwise for right obstacles, and full_rotate only as a last-resort recovery."
